  "description": "原始固定语义语言为中文；双语说明不改写语义。动作可选，仅是提示，不保证模型遵从。一次提示用于关联回合，会话规则可随时关闭；关闭不删除历史。新会话不继承规则，AI 发送表情不会启用绑定动作。 / Original fixed semantics are Chinese; bilingual descriptions do not rewrite them. Optional actions are guidance, not enforcement. One-time guidance applies to its linked turn; conversation rules can be disabled without erasing history. New conversations do not inherit rules; AI-sent expressions never activate bindings.",
  "examples": [
    "示例 / Example: 人→AI / Human→AI：「辛苦了」认可投入，可以只表达感谢。 “Thanks for the effort” acknowledges effort without requesting an action.",
    "示例 / Example: AI→人 / AI→Human：「不客气」自然回应感谢；「暂时没把握」坦诚不确定，不替代必要的查证。 “You are welcome” responds to thanks; “Unsure for now” admits uncertainty without replacing needed verification."
  ]
